{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22451","headline":"招萧处士 · 白居易","name":"招萧处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡内岂无人，所逢非所思。\n门前亦有客，相对不相知。\n仰望但云树，俯顾惟妻儿。\n寝食起居外，端然无所爲。\n东郊萧处士，聊可与开眉。\n能饮满杯酒，善吟长句诗。\n庭前吏散後，江畔路乾时。\n请君携竹杖，一赴郡斋期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}